libtranslate
------------------------------------------
Libtranslate is a library for translating text and web pages between natural
languages. Its modular infrastructure allows to implement new translation
services separately from the core library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libintl8-0.26-1
  libsoup2.4_1-2.60.3-1
  libtranslate-devel-0.99-1bl1
  libtranslate0-0.99-1bl1
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gtk-doc-1.37.0-1
  intltool-0.51.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libsoup2.4-devel-2.60.3-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://www.nongnu.org/libtranslate/

Canonical download:
  mirror://savannah/libtranslate/libtranslate-0.99.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libtranslate-0.99-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libtranslate-0.99-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libtranslate-0.99-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslate-0.99-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslate0-0.99-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libtranslate-devel-0.99-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

